{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/h/corporate-management/nio/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"user-community","title":"蔚来用户社区文化","url":"/h/corporate-management/nio/culture-and-values/user-community","wordCount":2430,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-enterprise-philosophy","title":"蔚来用户企业理念","url":"/h/corporate-management/nio/culture-and-values/user-enterprise-philosophy","wordCount":2463,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"nio-house-culture","title":"NIO House 的文化空间实践","url":"/h/corporate-management/nio/culture-and-values/nio-house-culture","wordCount":2556,"readingTime":11},{"seq":4,"slug":"li-bin-vision","title":"李斌的创业理念与领导哲学","url":"/h/corporate-management/nio/culture-and-values/li-bin-vision","wordCount":2688,"readingTime":11},{"seq":5,"slug":"mission-vision-values","title":"蔚来使命愿景价值观体系","url":"/h/corporate-management/nio/culture-and-values/mission-vision-values","wordCount":2447,"readingTime":10},{"seq":6,"slug":"user-centric-extremism","title":"极致用户导向文化","url":"/h/corporate-management/nio/culture-and-values/user-centric-extremism","wordCount":2614,"readingTime":11},{"seq":7,"slug":"startup-resilience","title":"蔚来创业韧性文化","url":"/h/corporate-management/nio/culture-and-values/startup-resilience","wordCount":3160,"readingTime":13}],"introMarkdown":"# 文化与价值观 简介\n\n蔚来的企业文化以\"用户企业\"为核心定位，这一理念贯穿了公司从产品定义到服务交付的全部环节。李斌在创立蔚来之初便明确提出，蔚来不仅是一家汽车公司，更是一家\"以用户为中心\"的社区型企业。\n\n本章从三个层面展开分析蔚来的文化体系建设：\n\n**蔚来用户社区文化** 探讨蔚来如何通过NIO Day等标志性活动，将用户从被动消费者转化为品牌共建者，以及用户信托基金等制度创新如何赋予用户真实的参与权。\n\n**蔚来用户企业理念** 深入解析\"用户拥有企业\"这一命题的商业逻辑，分析NIO Life、NIO House等生态产品如何承载和传递这一理念。\n\n**NIO House 的文化空间实践** 以NIO House为样本，观察蔚来如何通过物理空间设计来具象化品牌文化，以及会员自治机制如何在实践中运作。\n"}